<title>USA: Seibels over-allotment option exercised.</title>
<headline>Seibels over-allotment option exercised.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Seibels Bruce Group Inc said that the managing underwriters of its recent public offering, Advest Inc and Scott &amp; Stringfellow Inc, exercised their over-allotment option to buy 427,963 additional shares of common stock from the company at $7.00 per share.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including possible acquisitions, Seibels said.</p>
<p>The company provides automobile, flood and other property and casualty insurance services and products through independent agents primarily in the southeastern United States.</p>
</text>
